abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a spatiotemporal, physics-constrained,
  uncertainty-quantified graph Kolmogorov-Arnold network for multi-station
  geomagnetic and geoelectric forecasts. Prepared for the AGU 2026 Bright
  STaRS poster session.
